WEBVTT

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.700
Retto!

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.290
Tenkuji! Where's your change of clothes?

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.250
Never mind that! Kirara is...

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.790
Kirara is...

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.580
Super HXEROS!

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.750
Episode 5: HXEROS Rising!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.830
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.370
Even though I was with her...

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:17.410
It's not your fault, Tenkuji.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:22.160
None of us thought the Kiseichuu
would do something like this.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:27.660
That's right.
And we're all worried about Hoshino.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.000
Right, Momoka?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.370
Y-Yeah.

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:34.290
What's wrong, Momozono?

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.580
Nothing.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:43.080
Oh, no!
At this rate, none of us can fight!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.620
Hey, you guys,
if we do what we were told,

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.500
do you really think we'll be able
to save her so easily?

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.500
It could be a trap,
so don't you think we should be cautious

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:57.160
and build up our H-energy before we go?

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.910
You're right.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:00.870
But how?

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:02.950
Leave it to me!

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.410
Wait there, Retto.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.950
H-Hey!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.120
Are you serious?

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:23.700
I think you're the only one
who would get H-energy from that, Momoka.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:28.040
Wh-Why are you two
being so wimpy about it?

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.250
A HERO is about doing your best
to help your friends, right?

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:40.160
All right. I'm in.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.040
What are you guys doing
at a time like this?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:52.000
Um, Enjo, here.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.120
What do you think, Retto?

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:02.790
We might be seen, and you might see us.
That tension should get us all H-energy!

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.370
This is one of those win-win deals, right?

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.660
Only for you.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.160
Wh-What the...

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.000
Does he know about that
accidental discharge when I was fired up

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.000
and tried to store up H-energy myself?

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:31.540
Jeez. Too bad, you two.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.660
N-Never mind. Let's just go!

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:39.330
Also, if you're ever in danger, tell me!

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:43.120
It'll just be me,
but I'll be your shield.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:44.750
Enjo.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.250
Retto.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.410
Trying to look cool again.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:58.580
I said I would be their shield...

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:01.790
...but that's a tall order
in a situation like this!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.540
You're human, too, aren't you?

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.370
Why are you helping the Kiseichuu?

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:30.870
Huh? When did I say I was human?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.330
It's called mimicry.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:42.870
We Kiseichuu can change our forms
to fit in with Earth's ecosystem.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:48.870
Some of us have even slipped into human
society to enact changes from within.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:52.790
Well, now you know, but it's too late
for you to do anything about it.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.790
What?

00:05:54.790 --> 00:06:00.160
I'm going to report to the queen,
so keep a close eye on her.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.870
Understood.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:05.160
In any case, I have to escape somehow.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.620
If I could use my XERO gear
at a time like this...

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:09.950
That's it.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.540
Excuse me.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:16.830
It would be bad for you guys
if I built up H-energy, right?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:21.660
But I'm getting a rise
out of being tied up.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:24.250
Is that what you want?

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:30.330
This is why you humans
are such nuisances.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.250
Sheesh! That's what you get
for making me act like that!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:58.500
According to the XERO gear,
she's near here.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.330
You okay?

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.160
Yeah, more or less.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:12.200
Thank goodness.
Looks like no one's here.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.660
Human?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.700
What do I do now?

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.870
A human!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.580
You really are soft.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.370
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:40.080
You're the first human I've seen
in the flesh, and I acted on impulse.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:44.870
Why is she acting this way?
Is she really Kiseichuu?

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:49.370
What are you?
Are you with the Kiseichuu?

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:53.120
I'm Chacha,
the Queen's firstborn.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:56.200
In other words, I'm the Princess here!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:00.830
But I'm also the shunned child
that's born once every thousand years.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.870
I've been locked up in here
for as long as I can remember,

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:08.200
so I wouldn't say I'm with them.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.040
They keep you locked up?

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:13.290
But aren't you Kiseichuu,
just like the others?

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:17.200
Unfortunately,
they don't seem to think so.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:21.200
As you can see, I have mutations.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:27.660
I think they locked me up because my physical
makeup is so different from my brethren.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:33.950
Um, I trust that you're
a good female human,

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.410
so I'm going to ask you a favor.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.160
The name is Kirara.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.950
Would you set me free?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.950
This planet is interesting!

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:48.120
Even though the mating of the dominant
species is much more complicated

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:52.620
than other species, you flourish.
I've never heard of such a thing!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:57.080
I especially like
this country's soap operas!

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.250
H-Huh. You know a lot about us.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.620
You may know this already,

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:06.830
but my compatriots
are trying to wipe out humanity.

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:10.750
I want to prevent that,
no matter what it takes.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:14.580
I'm not asking you
to forgive my fellow Kiseichuu.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.080
I'm asking you to help me!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.870
All right.
I want to escape from here, too.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.790
Here?

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.450
So, how should we attack?

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:46.660
Gotta be a head-on assault, right?

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:47.870
Yes.

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:51.290
Yeah, especially after we powered up.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:54.370
We girls have to wreak some havoc.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:57.250
Okay. I'll go on ahead then.

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:59.620
There may be more Kiseichuu inside.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.580
But...

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.790
Leave it to us!

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:04.660
Right! We have to rescue Hoshino
as soon as possible!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:09.330
I swear we'll all make it back home!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.160
Yeah!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.580
Still, I can't believe
a human knocked you out.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:20.620
Sh-Shut up! She just caught me off guard!

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.410
Move it!

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.910
I can't let him get to her!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:43.080
Lamaze Cannon!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.200
Solar Ray!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:55.660
What's this? I was hoping
you'd leave one or two for me.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.500
This is no time for messing around!

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:09.370
All right, you know what happens when you
lay a hand on one of our dear friends?

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:12.870
You're about to find out, Kiseichuu!

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:15.040
Seductive Strike!

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.000
Restless Peony!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.250
Wait for me, Hoshino!

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:35.410
Gitai-Gitai Boo!

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.200
I'm Gitaichuu.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.790
I see.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:44.660
So if you build up H-energy,
you can wield great power?

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:47.910
Th-That's the way it works, yes.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:51.000
Then leave it to me!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:12:00.330
I told you that my mutations are what
make me different from my fellow Kiseichuu.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:06.120
Unlike them, I can release pheromones that make
it easier for other species to feel H-energy.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:13.620
Wh-What is this?

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:18.330
You're replenishing H-energy.
And I'm helping you.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.580
It's too powerful!

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:26.580
I can't take any more!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.290
There's no response.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:37.200
Kirara, did you imagine something
like you were supposed to?

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.620
Imagine what?

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.370
Sperm!

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:46.330
Wh-What are you talking about?
That's ridiculous!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:51.500
I don't get it.
You humans reproduce sexually, don't you?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.910
What's so embarrassing
about the instinct for survival?

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:58.660
You should be more honest with yourself.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:03.410
Look, humans have
this emotion called shyness.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.870
It sounds like something's
going on out there.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:09.000
The HXEROS are near the entrance!

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.160
Get over there!

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:13.750
Was that...

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:15.580
What's wrong?

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.540
Could it be?

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.750
Did they come here for me?

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:27.910
Chacha!
We may be able to get out of here!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.540
Really?

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.040
I'll really be able to leave?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.080
That's not going to happen.

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:38.080
No wonder I couldn't find you.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:41.200
You were hiding here.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.500
You have a role to play, hostage. Come!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.200
No! Let go of me!

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.910
Let go of Kirara!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.620
Well, well, Princess.

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:56.540
Don't tell me
you meant to aid this human.

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:58.370
What if I did?

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:02.120
You never thought of me as one of you!

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:04.950
Yes, that's right.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:09.330
If a mutant is not suited
for the environment, they're weeded out.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.250
It's only natural.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:14.830
Never forget that you're
only allowed to live out of pity

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.750
and because you're the Queen's firstborn,
Princess.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.790
W-Wait, Chacha!

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:31.830
I promise I'll come back for you!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:39.950
This is...

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.250
That's far enough!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:49.580
Be a good boy, and surrender.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.250
--Hoshino!
--Otherwise...

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:57.950
...my comrades and I
will siphon this female's H-energy

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:01.750
until she doesn't even have
the will to live.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.290
I-If you think you can do that,
give it a shot!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.790
I won't give in to your threats!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:09.950
Look at you blushing!

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:12.500
Maybe you've already experienced that?

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:16.450
Poor thing,
to have to go through that twice.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:23.700
All right.
This is the source of our power...

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.080
XERO gear.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:28.870
Without this,
we can't fight you Kiseichuu.

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:31.950
So leave Hoshino alone!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.500
What are you doing?

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.750
You said you would never forgive them!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:40.500
Yeah, but at the same time...

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:44.160
I can't forgive myself for failing
to protect you that day, Hoshino.

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:50.000
I don't want you
to feel like that ever again.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.660
Enjo...

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:55.410
I have another regret besides that.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:59.580
Why wasn't I able to tell you then...

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:03.410
...that having a lot of H-energy
is nothing to be ashamed of?

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.910
In fact, it's a good thing!

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:12.750
Why are you pulling my chain
at a time like this?

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:17.040
I'm not pulling your chain!
I seriously thought so then!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:20.500
So send that bug flying!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:24.410
You should be more honest with yourself.

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:27.250
More honest with myself...

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:32.580
I was like that, too, back then.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:41.580
Why did I forget that?

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.700
I'm soaked!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:49.500
With the rain, this year's Star Festival
will probably be canceled.

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.450
After I went to the trouble
of dressing up.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.410
We were supposed to meet up
with Date and them,

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.200
but why don't we take shelter
'til the rain lets up?

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:11.000
Hey, Ret, have you heard
of "summer Valentine's Day"?

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:16.540
I hear that, like Valentine's Day,
on the day of the Star Festival,

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:21.410
a girl gives candy to the boy she likes.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:23.750
H-Huh, I didn't know!

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.620
That's a new one on me!

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:30.910
Now that you mention it,
I am a little hungry.

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:33.870
Huh? What kind of reaction is that?

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.120
If you want my candy, you should say so.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:38.750
Okay! I want it!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:42.160
Sorry. I forgot to bring it.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.080
Why do you look so disappointed?

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.830
I-I'm not.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:55.200
What you said hasn't taken hold
in Japanese culture yet, so I don't care.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.200
There you go again, putting on a front.

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:01.330
Okay, then, if the rain stops...

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:07.000
I wouldn't mind buying you candy
at the festival.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.660
The rain's stopped!

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:19.790
They may have the festival after all.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.290
That's right.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:28.080
Back then, I didn't imagine
my high school life would be like this!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.950
I was supposed to get a boyfriend
and have dates after school.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:34.500
The two of us would spend
our day off together.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:38.580
I was supposed to enjoy every day.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:43.160
It's your fault.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:47.870
If it hadn't been for you Kiseichuu...

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:50.450
I might have been able to...

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:52.830
...confess my love to him!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.540
What was that H-energy?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.660
Could it be Kirara?

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:22.410
Hoshino!

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.790
Are you okay?

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.250
I'm weak as a kitten after that.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:33.200
Thank you, Ret.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:42.540
And I've got a favor to ask.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:47.080
Kirara...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.790
Looks like you did it.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:56.620
Now I can say
that it was worth being born.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.870
What is this?

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:23.160
Kirara! Are you all right?

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:26.950
I'm fine. Let's get out of here!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.700
But where's Enjo?

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:32.080
Don't worry about him.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:37.500
Hoshino told me everything.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.700
Come with me, Chacha!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.660
Enjo!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.540
Retto!

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.330
Enjo!

00:20:56.910 --> 00:21:01.500
What should I do? It's all my fault!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.790
It's okay. I'm sure Retto is safe.

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:13.120
And thanks to you, we rounded up
the Kiseichuu, so quit moping!

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:17.500
At last, we beat the Kiseichuu!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.370
S-Somebody!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.500
That voice! Enjo!

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:29.750
So this is a male human, eh?

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:32.830
And unlike the females,
this part is stiff.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:39.370
Another Kirara?

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:42.080
E-Everyone, calm down!

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:45.040
She's Kiseichuu, but she's on our side!

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.410
Huh. I see.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.250
Wait, what?

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:54.250
You mentioned beating the Kiseichuu
a minute ago...

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:58.410
...but destroying the nest doesn't mean
anything unless you defeat my mother.

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:05.250
Still, I like the fact that there are
humans who are able to beat us.

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:11.330
So from today,
I'll help you retrain your H-energy.

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:16.790
That aside, why are you mimicking me?

00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:49.580
Super HXEROS!

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:51.830
Next time: New Roommate (?)
